  "events": [
    {
      "text": "Two wings before the wind \u2014 an AI-painted maple-seed study. Inspired by the NPS bigleaf maple description: https://www.nps.gov/articles/000/bigleaf-maple.htm . Goal: filled curved silhouettes, a quiet cool ground, and selective copper lights. I will compare thin oil handling as the paired wings develop.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 10920,
      "afterStroke": 0
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 3
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 3
    },
    {
      "text": "The washes leave a quiet middle gap and a low shadow. I will bridge that space with two unequal wings, keeping their tips tapered.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 6240,
      "afterStroke": 3
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "The wings are filled, but only the left seed body is present. A second rounded body and a short shared stem will make the pair convincing; the shadow should stay smaller than the wings.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 8840,
      "afterStroke": 6
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 9
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 9
    },
    {
      "text": "The paired bodies are visible, but a pale slit separates them and the underside shadow is too linear. I will round the lower join and lay thin warm light inside each wing, leaving the darker edges exposed.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 9620,
      "afterStroke": 9
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "text": "The 3% body oil reads as a broad stepped patch; the 12% pass shows stronger parallel ridges. This is an informal comparison because the paths and colors differ. I will integrate the left patch with a wider acrylic midtone and give each seed a small rounded light.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 12220,
      "afterStroke": 12
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 15
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "The acrylic glaze barely subdued the stepped oil stripe. The seed lights are clear but too crescent-like. Before further lights, I will establish two thin structural ribs and a darker central seam to separate the bodies.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 9360,
      "afterStroke": 15
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 1,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 18
    },
    {
      "kind": "look",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5
      },
      "duration": 1200,
