      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 22
    },
    {
      "text": "The long ribs now read; tiny branches are subdued. The seed bodies still resemble hollow crescents, so I will fill their lit planes with broader midtones and replace the pale central slit with a warm dark join.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
        "zoom": 2,
