      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 25
    },
    {
      "text": "The broad seed planes close the hollow effect and the dark seam removes the bright slit. The base still rests on a straight dark bar. I will break that bar with a cool ground touch and clarify the curved stalk rising between the wings.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
