      },
      "duration": 1200,
      "afterStroke": 28
    },
    {
      "text": "The curved stalk is now legible. The ground touch softened the dark bar only slightly; more covering may enlarge the base. I will keep its small contact role and place two short lights on the upper wing edges, with a softer warm transition on the right seed.",
      "kind": "notice",
      "camera": {
