      "text": "Finished: Two wings before the wind. The enlarged seed glint is now visible, the filled wings remain unequal, and the curved stalk connects the pair. Broad seed midtones solved the hollow crescents; fine acrylic ribs did not show over oil, while oil ribs did. Regular ridges and a slightly hard contact base remain. I will stop here because more lights would compete with the small seed focus. Next experiment: matched curved oil paths at 3%, 12%, and 30% body on the same ground.",
